    "description": "Stay connected with friends and family in Messages app.\r\nSend and receive texts instantly, even without an internet connection. Wide range of emojis for text messaging\r\n\r\nWith its intuitive interface, the Messages app lets you stay in touch without interrupting your tasks. Fast, reliable messaging for your Android device\r\n\r\nKey Features of Messages app:\r\n- Sending text Messages without Internet Access\r\n- Secure messaging app with a quick messaging capability\r\n- Themes assistance\r\n- Quick search option\r\n- Quick-reply SMS notifications\r\n- Emoji in text, making it better than ever\r\n- Block unwanted contacts & spam messages \r\n\r\nSend and receive texts offline, schedule messages. Personalize with colorful themes, use emojis to express yourself, and chat in your preferred language.\r\n\r\nGet a fast, simple, and reliable text messaging experience with Messages. Download now to change the way you send messaged.",
